674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UD629JKvm4gQ7kNvwENgjYi&_nc_oc=AdoD9lSfRWEeoyLyOLh6_XMD8VLy5wgBnzOX8UtVTW-s72-aWI-G4pAZDeDcEEsQWiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7iZWjyhUnklGtIBA65LwC11Gh_ELhDXS45hoMflA8e6Q&oe=6A170059"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AP9npfXB5WcQ7kNvwEEN9Xb&_nc_oc=AdpRUqdXCs741aL5IrRaSCbdUQEXZy4xfwJv_i6Jvt1l49y7BaOMQc5ovGthdsmg0Ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Ee_3Ivy8p1umetCFTsBovzlkcGSRdRHI429LOybBfBg&oe=6A170916"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oeI_rm-yzjwQ7kNvwHEvYcQ&_nc_oc=AdqTJT2_PO6K2QjR5B9dhmdTNqhAz9bUKpnxtQHgc3d6FxJkSL2dxboC1xwmoK5lOcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6BfPHBtesdj9xOhFvelxTL-WuhMGhuMOg5nTs-cZmQxQ&oe=6A170531"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip